msgid "ReliefNT 5.3.0"
msgstr "ReliefNT 5.3.0"

msgid "更新内容"
msgstr "Changes"

msgid ""
"新增针对 ReliefNT 编译的 Linux 风格 **.ko 可加载模块**：使用原版 Kbuild/modpost、ELF64 重定位、导出符号类型 "
"CRC、vermagic、参数和依赖校验，实现 init_module、finit_module、delete_module 及 /proc/modules、/sys/module "
"状态视图。defconfig 默认内置，支持独立生命周期的部件可选 y/m/n。"
msgstr ""
"Added Linux-style **loadable .ko modules** compiled for ReliefNT, using upstream Kbuild/modpost, "
"ELF64 relocation, exported-symbol type CRCs, vermagic, parameter/dependency checks, init_module, "
"finit_module, delete_module, and /proc/modules and /sys/module state views. defconfig defaults to "
"built-in components; those with independent lifecycles can select y/m/n."

msgid ""
"模块、设备、打开文件、挂载、VMA、IRQ、DMA 和在途回调统一保留实现 owner；引用未排空或硬件停止失败时拒绝释放。增加模块安装清单、树外模块构建及匹配的 prepared "
"SDK，并支持薄 newc initramfs 的早期启动。"
msgstr ""
"Modules, devices, open files, mounts, VMAs, IRQs, DMA, and in-flight callbacks consistently retain"
" implementation owners; outstanding references or hardware-stop failure prevent freeing. Added "
"module installation manifests, out-of-tree builds, matching prepared SDKs, and early boot with a "
"thin newc initramfs."

msgid ""
"新增 **EHCI USB 2.0** 与 **xHCI USB 3.x** 主机驱动，支持 BOT/SCSI U 盘、boot HID 键盘及相对鼠标、热移除和读写保护。块层增加经校验的 DOS"
" MBR/EBR 分区识别，并保留 GPT 校验。"
msgstr ""
"Added **EHCI USB 2.0** and **xHCI USB 3.x** host drivers, supporting BOT/SCSI USB storage, boot "
"HID keyboards and relative mice, hot removal, and read/write protection. The block layer adds "
"validated DOS MBR/EBR partition recognition while retaining GPT validation."

msgid ""
"重构物理内存拓扑、稀疏元数据及早期页表，解除原有 **16 GiB** 管理范围限制；物理直映射与设备 MMIO 使用独立窗口，DMA 分配按设备地址能力约束。小对象堆使用可回收 "
"slab，减少连续页分配和持锁清零开销。"
msgstr ""
"Reworked physical memory topology, sparse metadata, and early page tables, removing the old **16 "
"GiB** management limit. Physical direct mapping and device MMIO use separate windows; DMA "
"allocation respects device address capabilities. Small-object heaps use reclaimable slabs to "
"reduce contiguous-page allocation and zeroing under locks."

msgid ""
"增加 clean 页缓存回收、私有匿名页换出/换入、Linux version 1 swap 文件及分区、swapoff 恢复和 OOM 选择。提供真实 "
"/proc/swaps、meminfo、vmstat 与 sysinfo 统计；当前 swap 后端限于具备所需同步 I/O 契约的 AHCI SATA。"
msgstr ""
"Added clean page-cache reclaim, private anonymous swap-out/in, Linux version 1 swap "
"files/partitions, swapoff recovery, and OOM selection. Real /proc/swaps, meminfo, vmstat, and "
"sysinfo statistics are provided. Swap backends currently support only AHCI SATA with the required "
"synchronous I/O contract."

msgid ""
"完善 MADV_DONTNEED、mincore、mlock/munlock 及共享匿名 backing 生命周期；JIT 权限转换、远端 TLB/CPU 同步和 exec "
"映像准入按实际映射处理，内存不足保留明确错误与可恢复状态。"
msgstr ""
"Completed MADV_DONTNEED, mincore, mlock/munlock, and shared anonymous backing lifecycles. JIT "
"permission transitions, remote TLB/CPU synchronization, and exec image admission follow actual "
"mappings; memory exhaustion retains explicit errors and recoverable state."

msgid ""
"将对象、管道、PTY、epoll、共享匿名文件及网络注册表改为按需分配，修正 select 位图范围、管道容量/原子写入、memfd 稀疏页面与 seals；完善 TCP "
"排队发送、重传、超时、半关闭和最后引用关闭后的发送生命周期。"
msgstr ""
"Changed object, pipe, PTY, epoll, shared-anonymous-file, and network registries to on-demand "
"allocation. Fixed select bitmap ranges, pipe capacity/atomic writes, sparse memfd pages, and "
"seals; completed TCP queued transmission, retransmission, timeouts, half-close, and send "
"lifecycles after the final reference closes."

msgid ""
"新增 **IPv6 双栈主机协议栈**，覆盖 UDP/TCP/raw ICMPv6、邻居发现、重复地址检测、SLAAC、扩展首部、源端分片与重组。提供 Linux "
"AF_INET6、辅助数据、IPv4 映射地址、rtnetlink 地址/路由管理及 IPv6 proc 视图。"
msgstr ""
"Added an **IPv6 dual-stack host stack** covering UDP/TCP/raw ICMPv6, neighbor discovery, duplicate"
" address detection, SLAAC, extension headers, source fragmentation, and reassembly. Provides Linux"
" AF_INET6, ancillary data, IPv4-mapped addresses, rtnetlink address/route management, and IPv6 "
"proc views."

msgid "扩展 procfs 的进程/线程、映射、文件描述符、系统资源、磁盘、网络与 OOM 视图，按对象身份、权限和快照规则输出，避免旧固定展示范围截断真实资源。"
msgstr ""
"Expanded procfs views for processes/threads, mappings, descriptors, system resources, disks, "
"networks, and OOM. Output follows object identity, permissions, and snapshot rules, avoiding "
"truncation of actual resources by old fixed display limits."

msgid "增加执行锁等待、持有和关中断窗口的可控统计，并允许符合条件的独占地址空间私有页故障并行处理；保留执行写事务、共享 MM、信号及任务生命周期的同步边界。"
msgstr ""
"Added controllable statistics for execution-lock waits, holds, and interrupt-disabled windows, and"
" parallel handling of eligible private-page faults in exclusive address spaces. Retained "
"synchronization boundaries for execution write transactions, shared MM, signals, and task "
"lifecycles."

msgid "修复 vmwgfx FIFO 背压、资源退休及 GPU 所有权路径；暂时拥塞返回可重试状态，简单 KMS PRESENT 避免通用渲染元数据分配，减少重复唤醒、清零和呈现开销。"
msgstr ""
"Fixed vmwgfx FIFO backpressure, resource retirement, and GPU ownership paths. Temporary congestion"
" returns retryable status; simple KMS PRESENT avoids generic rendering metadata allocation, "
"reducing repeated wakeups, zeroing, and presentation overhead."

msgid ""
"增加可选 VGA 文本控制台，移除旧 Desktop/windowd 的内核专用授权与接口；整理独立内核 Kconfig、Sphinx 手册和原生测试归属，修复宿主测试登记及夹具依赖，恢复独立 "
"CI 门禁。"
msgstr ""
"Added an optional VGA text console and removed legacy Desktop/windowd-specific kernel "
"authorization and interfaces. Organized independent kernel Kconfig, Sphinx manuals, and native-"
"test ownership, fixed host test registration and fixture dependencies, and restored independent CI"
" gates."

msgid "破坏性更新"
msgstr "Breaking Changes"

msgid "**是，涉及内核模块、驱动 ABI、已退休接口及内部开发路径。**"
msgstr "**Yes: kernel modules, driver ABI, retired interfaces, and internal development paths.**"

msgid ""
".ko 必须针对匹配的 ReliefNT 配置、工具链、导出类型 CRC 和完整版本重新编译；不兼容 Linux 原版二进制模块或全部 Linux 内部 API，不提供忽略版本/CRC "
"的强制加载。"
msgstr ""
".ko files must be rebuilt for matching ReliefNT configuration, toolchain, exported type CRCs, and "
"full version. Upstream Linux binaries and all Linux internal APIs are not compatible targets; no "
"forced loading bypasses version/CRC checks."

msgid "驱动服务表为版本 2，扩展字段按大小校验，旧版本描述符在初始化前拒绝。保留历史前缀不等于旧驱动二进制兼容。"
msgstr ""
"The driver service table is version 2, with extension fields checked by size and old-version "
"descriptors rejected before initialization. Retaining the historical prefix does not imply "
"compatibility with old driver binaries."

msgid "旧桌面角色、窗口服务专用接口和相关授权已移除；设备操作使用现行文件权限、Linux capability 和公开 UAPI，不能继续依赖已退休的桌面身份。"
msgstr ""
"Legacy desktop roles, window-service-specific interfaces, and related authorization are removed. "
"Device operations use current file permissions, Linux capabilities, and public UAPI; retired "
"desktop identities can no longer be relied on."

msgid "Kconfig 仅承载内核实际消费的配置；依赖已删除选项、旧文档位置或私有结构布局的脚本、补丁和树外模块需要迁移。"
msgstr ""
"Kconfig carries only configuration actually consumed by the kernel. Scripts, patches, and out-of-"
"tree modules relying on removed options, old document locations, or private structure layouts need"
" migration."

msgid "更新与迁移注意事项"
msgstr "Update and Migration Notes"

msgid ""
"本次为 **正式源码 Release**，不附预编译内核、模块或 SDK。使用标签源码和锁定依赖重新构建，保持内核、符号、UAPI、模块与配套用户态一致；ReliefOS 独立发布系统集成。"
msgstr ""
"This **stable source Release** includes no precompiled kernel, modules, or SDK. Rebuild tagged "
"source with pinned dependencies, keeping kernel, symbols, UAPI, modules, and accompanying "
"userspace aligned. ReliefOS publishes system integration independently."

msgid ""
"在新的 O 目录构建；复用配置时执行 olddefconfig，核对所需驱动的 y/m/n。默认生产部件内置，启动核心保持内置；模块化根设备需要由操作系统提供匹配的 initramfs "
"和依赖闭包。"
msgstr ""
"Build in a new O directory. When reusing configuration, run olddefconfig and check required "
"drivers' y/m/n settings. Production components default to built-in and boot cores remain built-in."
" Modular root devices require OS-provided matching initramfs and the complete dependency closure."

msgid ""
"swap 需要显式准备并启用，内核选项本身不创建交换空间。当前仅支持经准入的 AHCI SATA 文件或块后端；NVMe、USB 等后端不支持，普通文件必须完整分配。共享、设备、锁定或 "
"pinned 页面等不属于当前换出范围，swapoff 可能因内存或 I/O 问题失败并保留活动区域。"
msgstr ""
"Swap requires explicit preparation and activation; the kernel option alone creates no swap space. "
"Only admitted AHCI SATA file/block backends are supported; NVMe, USB, and other backends are "
"unsupported, and regular files must be fully allocated. Shared, device, locked, pinned, and "
"similar pages are outside current swap-out scope. swapoff may fail due to memory or I/O issues, "
"retaining the active area."

msgid ""
"USB 支持范围为已实现的 BOT 存储及 boot HID；xHCI 不支持 Hub 路由，尚无 UAS、等时传输或任意 HID 描述符解释器。SuperSpeedPlus 速率解析不等于实测 "
"10/20 Gbit/s 链路或吞吐认证。"
msgstr ""
"USB support covers implemented BOT storage and boot HID. xHCI has no Hub routing, UAS, isochronous"
" transfers, or arbitrary HID descriptor interpreter yet. SuperSpeedPlus rate parsing is not "
"measured 10/20 Gbit/s link or throughput certification."

msgid ""
"IPv6 为主机实现，不提供路由转发、IPsec 或全部组播扩展；DNS/RDNSS 与 DHCPv6 客户端属于用户态。链路本地地址需要接口区域，地址/路由管理与 raw socket "
"分别受对应 capability 限制。"
msgstr ""
"IPv6 is a host implementation without routing/forwarding, IPsec, or all multicast extensions. "
"DNS/RDNSS and DHCPv6 clients belong in userspace. Link-local addresses require an interface scope,"
" and address/route management and raw sockets require their respective capabilities."

msgid "**64 TiB** 是直映射窗口设计上限，不是已验证 RAM 容量。内存回收、OOM、执行锁及 GPU 改进不构成桌面延迟、实时性或统一吞吐承诺。"
msgstr ""
"**64 TiB** is the direct-map window's design ceiling, not validated RAM capacity. Memory reclaim, "
"OOM, execution-lock, and GPU improvements promise neither desktop latency, real-time behavior, nor"
" uniform throughput."

msgid ""
"本次发布核对版本生成、数字宏和严格文档构建，内核编译及宿主回归由版本提交的 CI 验证。历史单项 QEMU 结果不等于本标签整版复验；**VMware "
"验证未完成**，物理硬件、长期稳定性和完整本机自举未完成验收。"
msgstr ""
"Release checks cover version generation, numeric macros, and strict documentation builds; version-"
"commit CI validates kernel compilation and host regressions. Historical individual QEMU results "
"are not full retesting of this tag. **VMware validation is incomplete**; physical hardware, long-"
"term stability, and complete native self-hosting have not passed acceptance."

msgid "开发者提示"
msgstr "Developer Notes"

msgid ""
"基础版本为 **5.3.0**，生成数字字段为 **5/3/0**；EXTRAVERSION/LOCALVERSION 与原生模块 ABI 后缀独立生成，完整 release 仍受 31 "
"字节上限约束。"
msgstr ""
"The base version is **5.3.0**, with generated numeric fields **5/3/0**. EXTRAVERSION/LOCALVERSION "
"and native module ABI suffixes are generated separately; full release strings remain limited to 31"
" bytes."

msgid ""
"使用根 Make、各目录 Kbuild、Module.symvers 和正式 headers_install 输出；prepared SDK 必须与内核 ABI "
"匹配，不能通过改写版本字符串冒充匹配。"
msgstr ""
"Use root Make, per-directory Kbuild, Module.symvers, and official headers_install output. Prepared"
" SDKs must match the kernel ABI; changing version strings cannot impersonate a match."

msgid "执行锁统计是 ReliefNT 自身的采样接口，不等同 Linux lockstat；启用采样会产生开销，报告时保留配置、平台和对照。"
msgstr ""
"Execution-lock statistics are ReliefNT's own sampling interface, not Linux lockstat. Sampling has "
"overhead; retain configuration, platform, and comparison details in reports."

msgid ""
"原始 ABI golden 未重生成；版本 2 的追加驱动字段由独立夹具检查。定向宿主及 Linux ABI 测试通过不表示完整 POSIX/Linux 认证，未实现功能继续返回明确错误。"
msgstr ""
"Original ABI golden data was not regenerated; independent fixtures check version 2's appended "
"driver fields. Passing targeted host and Linux ABI tests is not complete POSIX/Linux "
"certification. Unimplemented features still return explicit errors."

msgid ""
"本说明覆盖内核 5.1.2 版本提交 **6ed7a28eccd191f20d872de4d169c9059a5bbbe7** 之后至本标签的有效更新，不含 ReliefOS "
"应用、桌面和镜像打包；下一版以本次版本提交为起点。"
msgstr ""
"These notes cover effective updates after the 5.1.2 kernel version commit "
"**6ed7a28eccd191f20d872de4d169c9059a5bbbe7** through this tag, excluding ReliefOS applications, "
"desktop, and image packaging. The next version starts at this version commit."
